<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Somanetics started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Somanetics started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brean Murray said it initiated coverage of Somanetics Corp with a strong buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said company has the only FDA-cleared, non-invasive monitoring device that directly measures oxygen levels in the brain.</p>
<p>-- the stock was flat at 3-7/16.</p>
</text>
